      "en": {
        "name": "Noveske CHF Chrome Lined Barrel 5.56x45mm 11.5 inch barrel",
        "shortName": "Noveske 11.5\" 556",
        "description": "Our chrome lined barrels are cold hammered forged and made with the material callouts and manufacturing process for the M249 Machine Gun barrel.\n\nThe cold hammer forging process work hardens the steel around a rifled mandrel, which creates the lands and grooves. The barrel is then chrome lined to the spec for a M249 Machine Gun barrel, which is about twice as thick as that of an M4 barrel. The end result is a rifle that can be run hard day after day. For any high round count, high temperature, heavy shooting, we recommend our chrome lined barrel.\n\nPremium Cold Hammer Forged (CHF) 5.56mm Noveske barrels available in 10.5\", 12.5\", 13.7\", 14.5\", and 16.1\" lengths. Each barrel is CHF-formed with a 1:7 twist and 5.56 NATO chamber, magnetic‑particle inspected for material integrity, and fitted with a Noveske low‑profile .750\" journal gas block pinned to the barrel. All include an M4‑style barrel extension and ½\"x28 muzzle threads. The only exception is the Skinny Profile 14.5\", which features a .625\" journal. "
      }
    },
